The flattened X-HEEP RTL in
physical_design/nangate45/xheep/openroad/xheep_flat.v is based on the
upstream X-HEEP project (https://github.com/x-heep/x-heep). The upstream
Solderpad Hardware License is included in LICENSE-XHEEP. Third-party IP
components may have separate licensing terms.

The Nangate45 platform libraries are not included in this repository. The
final layout uses the platform's fakeram macro as an empty placeholder; see
README.md for the physical-design limitations.
